00:00:27.806 --> 00:00:31.098
This is the seed mantra of Goddess Saraswati.

00:00:31.224 --> 00:00:36.798
Chanting this mantra enhances our ability to acquire knowledge.

00:00:37.049 --> 00:00:39.525
And it develops our intellect.

00:00:40.117 --> 00:00:45.000
This mantra aids in improving our focus and memory.

00:00:45.682 --> 00:00:48.176
So, let's chant this miraculous mantra 

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:51.072
"Om Aim Namah" 

00:00:51.341 --> 00:00:56.502
and truly experience the magical power within us.

00:00:57.293 --> 00:01:00.137
Sit in Sukhasana on your mat (Katasana)

00:01:01.286 --> 00:01:03.286
Stay as still as possible 

00:01:03.717 --> 00:01:05.699
and strive to sit up straight.

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:11.740
Place your palms on your knees facing up.

00:01:14.147 --> 00:01:17.853
Touch your thumb to your index finger; 

00:01:21.362 --> 00:01:23.739
let the other three fingers extend. 

00:01:25.912 --> 00:01:27.768
This is called Gyan Mudra.

00:01:29.474 --> 00:01:32.228
Now gently close your eyes.

00:01:34.779 --> 00:01:36.420
Relax your body.

00:01:38.073 --> 00:01:40.827
Focus entirely on your breath.

00:01:43.054 --> 00:01:46.724
Now Inhale slowly.

00:01:50.118 --> 00:01:53.142
slowly Exhale

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:02.032
Will Do This 5 Times

00:02:04.744 --> 00:02:06.546
Keep your focus on your breath.

00:02:09.276 --> 00:02:10.665
Inhale

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.459
Exhale

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.515
Inhale

00:02:36.364 --> 00:02:38.202
Exhale

00:02:44.596 --> 00:02:46.596
Inhale

00:02:52.307 --> 00:02:54.000
Exhale

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.838
Inhale

00:03:06.365 --> 00:03:09.838
Exhale

00:03:14.456 --> 00:03:17.534
Inhale

00:03:21.305 --> 00:03:23.305
Exhale

00:03:24.329 --> 00:03:27.604
Slowly feel your mind calming down.

00:03:29.112 --> 00:03:33.485
Now slowly chant "Om Aim Namah"

00:03:35.191 --> 00:03:39.363
Om

00:03:39.809 --> 00:03:43.092
Aim 

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.864
Namah

00:03:54.557 --> 00:03:58.281
Do this process and chant "Om Aim Namah" ten times.

00:03:58.981 --> 00:04:02.921
Keep your eyes closed throughout the procedure.

